{"h":3188,"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.06035622914632166,"t":"Test 2","h":0.015773995757252579,"y":0.044438583488698113,"c":1,"x":0.84144350694947867},{"x":0.081081090116263771,"w":0.71235519409179693,"c":1,"y":0.094416562342655719,"t":"This increasing ability to measure factors related to weather helped scientists to understand","h":0.013174404015056429},{"w":0.68918919881184904,"h":0.013174404015056429,"t":"the atmosphere and its processes better, and they started collecting weather observation","x":0.083011578114989298,"y":0.11041405297371032,"c":1},{"x":0.081081073929987896,"w":0.70656372070312501,"h":0.016030317567373054,"t":"data systematically. In the eighteenth century, the scientist and politician Benjamin Franklin","y":0.12641154317340519,"c":1},{"y":0.14240903363853552,"t":"carried out work on electricity and lightning in particular, but he was also very interested in","x":0.083011579680007802,"w":0.69884170532226564,"h":0.01317440401505654,"c":1},{"t":"weather and studied it throughout most of his life. It was Franklin who discovered that storms Q39","h":0.014558591687095945,"c":1,"w":0.77220077514648444,"y":0.15840652435354308,"x":0.081081079515984228},{"t":"generally travel from west to east.","y":0.17440401488705903,"x":0.083011579779456543,"h":0.01317440401505654,"w":0.26254826863606767,"c":1},{"y":0.19912790721101348,"t":"in addition to new meteorological instruments, other developments contributed to our","x":0.081081076853943446,"w":0.66216217041015635,"c":1,"h":0.014534883247863672},{"y":0.21511627922098109,"t":"understanding of the atmosphere. People in different locations began to keep records, and in","w":0.71814671834309896,"h":0.013081395042735311,"x":0.084942084748996269,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"the mid-nineteenth century, the invention of the telegraph made it possible for these records","x":0.083011592052798455,"y":0.23110465139716108,"h":0.014534883247863672,"w":0.71235519409179693},{"w":0.69498067220052084,"t":"to be collated. This led, by the end of the nineteenth century, to the first weather services.","x":0.083011594301239403,"h":0.013196288267970813,"y":0.248431618553832,"c":1},{"y":0.27180232573227325,"c":1,"x":0.084942083879689864,"t":"It was not until the early twentieth century that mathematics and physics became part of","w":0.68146718343098966,"h":0.013081395042735311},{"c":1,"h":0.013230938833660333,"x":0.084942076971022351,"y":0.28764115403280699,"t":"meteorology, and we' continue from that point next week.","w":0.45173746744791671},{"x":0.27899198407397707,"t":"S08F87 E(250S : 7IELTSF","y":0.44691108174722061,"w":0.44181432088216144,"h":0.10706350405512366,"c":0.30000001192092896},{"t":"107","x":0.87065637080578051,"y":0.95058139546341347,"h":0.013081395042735311,"w":0.034749034245808885,"c":1}]}